# Ad-hoc agent debug scripts belong in scratch, not the repo root.
/*.cjs
!remove_bg.cjs

# The Obsidian vault is its own private repository (Texas-Sons/vault) that
# happens to sit in this folder. It must never be committed here: `git add -A`
# has swept stray files into this repo before, and the vault holds personal
# notes rather than project source. Better still, move it outside this
# directory — nesting one git repo inside another invites exactly that mistake.
/vault/

# Local responsive audit outputs
.audit-profile/
.audit-shots/
